[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10683.51, "timestamp": "02:58:03", "text": "小心那些会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10693.83, "timestamp": "02:58:13", "text": "我被困在这里，只能看着这些红色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10700.309, "timestamp": "02:58:20", "text": "不，我说的红色是指最烫的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10702.15, "timestamp": "02:58:22", "text": "那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10706.95, "timestamp": "02:58:26", "text": "呃，红色的那种，就是带红色光环的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10709.59, "timestamp": "02:58:29", "text": "我指的是那些着火的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10712.63, "timestamp": "02:58:32", "text": "哦，不是那个着火的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10715.19, "timestamp": "02:58:35", "text": "好吧，那这些就太奇怪了。 他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10734.469, "timestamp": "02:58:54", "text": "是的，这些人要过很久才会死。"}]